    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "This is still a fix in a dependency, not in InstantSearch. We made a lot of dependency updates that fixes some bugs at different levels but we do not document them in the Changelog. Also, the fix is already available in the users using the CJS or ESM builds, making it confusing saying **this** specific version of InstantSearch fixes this bug, which is false.",
